{"text":"夫三寶益潤，沾及存亡。是以清信女佛弟子黄法僧爲亡妣敬造無量壽像一區。願亡者生天，捨苦得樂；居家現〔存〕，恒與善會。復願修福日進，正念無退。含生有識，同歸斯澤。孝昌三年正月十五日。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三寶","refId":null,"text":"三寶","start":1,"end":3},{"name":"PersonName","term":"法僧","refId":null,"text":"法僧","start":20,"end":22},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無量壽","refId":null,"text":"無量壽","start":27,"end":30},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"離苦","refId":null,"text":"捨苦","start":40,"end":42},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"得洛","refId":null,"text":"得樂","start":42,"end":44},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"正念","refId":null,"text":"正念","start":64,"end":66},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"含生","start":69,"end":71},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"有識","start":71,"end":73}]}